{"metadata":{"extendedModule":"HeadwireInput","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"shortcut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Character","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SJ"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"adding","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyModifiers","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13HeadwireInput12KeyModifiersV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyStroke","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13HeadwireInput9KeyStrokeV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","title":"shortcut(for:adding:)","externalID":"s:13HeadwireInput17KeyboardLayoutMapV8shortcut3for6addingAA9KeyStrokeVSgSJ_AA0I9ModifiersVtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"HeadwireInput"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwireinput\/keyboardlayoutmap\/shortcut(for:adding:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/KeyboardLayoutMap\/shortcut(for:adding:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput","doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/KeyboardLayoutMap"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The keystroke that presses a character’s key with more modifiers held, as a shortcut such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as ⌘C; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".none"},{"type":"text","text":" when the layout has no single key for it."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"shortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalP